        TableForm[BoxForm`e$]]]}]], "Input"], Cell["Plots versus mass", 
   "Subsection"], Cell["This plotting cell is deliberately separate. It \
displays real and imaginary parts, absolute values on a logarithmic scale, \
and principal phases as functions of nu=m_t/H.", "Text"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"massDependencePlots", "[", "massData", "]"}]], 
   "Input"], Cell["Dimensional-mass interface", "Subsection"], 
  Cell["For specified mt and Hubble scale H, only the ratio mt/H enters.", 
